  "cil_liability": false,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would fail to provide a satisfactory standard of accommodation for future occupiers. The communal kitchen/dining area due to its long and narrow layout would provide a poor, unsafe and impractical shared living space for six occupiers. Bedroom 2 would also be located directly adjacent to the communal ground floor toilet and kitchen, resulting in undue noise and disturbance, and the submitted plans do not demonstrate that the bedrooms can be furnished and used satisfactorily. The proposal would therefore fail to provide a high-quality form of shared accommodation, contrary to Sections 8 and 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies D5 and D6 of the London Plan, Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy, and Policies DMD5 and DMD8 of the Development Management Document.",
    "The proposed development fails to provide adequate and policy-compliant cycle parking, by reason of the convoluted and impractical route through the dwelling and the absence of satisfactory external access. The proposal would therefore fail to provide a secure and convenient cycle parking facility and would not promote sustainable modes of transport, contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies T4 and T5 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy 25 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD45 and DMD47 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ]
